## Context

Ticket 4471 combines two causes. Matching subjects is neither necessary nor sufficient
for duplication. The working explorer already distinguishes causes using tenant locale,
form version and report channel. Report bodies can still reveal unexplained symptoms.

## Proposed replacement for decision 0001

Preserve the accepted [decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject) as history.
Replace its operational rule: deduplicate repeated export rows by report ID first; read
each report and establish its cause using tenant configuration and channel. Merge only
when cause evidence agrees. Keep parser and hint fixes separate. Unknown tenants or
conflicting symptoms require investigation, not an automatic merge.

<DedupeExplorer />

## Consequences

Triage requires reading and tenant lookup. Different subjects may merge and identical
subjects may stay apart. Counts and supporting report IDs must remain reproducible when
new exports arrive. The classifier supports triage; it does not prove unexplained bodies
share its assigned root cause.

